>ok i have a problem making the boot disk it formats the disk fine but im not
>gettig a transfer of my autoexec.bat can someone help?

OK, if I understand you correctly you have formatted a boot disk by
using the "format a /s" command. What happens then is that the disk is
formatted and the files command.com, io.sys and msdos.sys are copied to
the disk.(io.sys and msdos.sys are hidden files so you will not see them
with the "dir" command)
The files config.sys and autoexec.bat you will have to manually copy
to your boot disk. 

Good luck. 



